  "notes": "A slim tower-house 4.5 m square and 30 m tall, turquoise tile with white corner quoins and narrow slit windows, under an open belvedere and a steep terracotta pyramid roof with a ball finial. The door is on local -Z under a striped awning; stairs climb seven floors to the belvedere, which has a 1.25 m parapet. White limewash with cobalt trim since v2.",
